#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/index.md:10
msgid "Typed I/O reference"
msgstr "类型化 I/O 参考"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/index.md:12
msgid ""
"Choose the interface by the operation you need. The declarations define "
"portable identities, formats, borrowing and execution requirements; the "
"selected part, Board and provider determine the available modes. Factory "
"lookup returns an existing face and performs no startup or allocation."
msgstr ""
"按所需操作选择接口。声明定义可移植身份、格式、借用及执行要求；所选料号、板卡和 provider 决定可用模式。Factory "
"查找返回已有接口，不启动硬件，也不分配存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/index.md:14
msgid ""
"Accepted requests and buffers remain borrowed until acquire-observed "
"SETTLED. Explicit progress, deadline observation, final hardware withdrawal "
"and external joins retain their separate responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"已接受的请求和缓冲区在以 acquire 语义观测到 SETTLED 前持续借用。显式推进、截止时间观测、最终硬件撤回及外部 join 保持各自职责。"
